  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to perish; to fall; to die out",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to perish; to be destroyed; to die out",
      "explanation": "Of a country, a family, a species or a culture: to come to an end and disappear. A godan variant of {滅|ほろ}びる with the same meaning."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31716_horobu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{滅|ほろ}ぶ。",
      "english": "A nation falls.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31716_horobu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{恐竜|きょうりゅう}→恐竜：10428_kyouryuu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦なぜ→なぜ：01484_naze⟧{滅|ほろ}んだ⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦か→か：09473_ka⟧。",
      "english": "Why did the dinosaurs die out?",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31716_horobu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{権力|けんりょく}→権力：10020_kenryoku⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{溺|おぼ}れた→溺れる：02026_oboreru⟧⟦{一族|いちぞく}→一族：11229_ichizoku⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧、⟦やがて→やがて：03637_yagate⟧⟦{内部|ないぶ}→内部：05583_naibu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{争|あらそ}い→争い：09992_arasoi⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{滅|ほろ}んでいった。",
      "english": "The clan, drunk on power, eventually destroyed itself through internal strife.",
